# Conformance probe pack for an inner message after a whole length (spec 0.34,
# ruling 3), most significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   byte 0      the length of the whole message in bytes
#   byte 1      n
#   the rest    one conformance-inner-twokinds message, up to the stated length
format     conformance-inner-whole
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
length  8  whole
field   probe.n  8  uint
inner   conformance-inner-twokinds
